<title>CROATIA: Croatia June oil, natural gas output fall slightly.</title>
<headline>Croatia June oil, natural gas output fall slightly.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Croatian State Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics issued the following production figures.</p>
<p>				     JUNE	  MAY	 JUNE 96</p>
<p> Crude oil	 (tonnes)    125,447    132,225     108,530</p>
<p> Natural gas (000 cu m)	137,132    148,496     111,580</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCTS (tonnes)</p>
<p> Gasoline			  106,639     95,381	76,578</p>
<p> Gas oil			    93,983     56,537	89,032</p>
<p> Heating oil		     107,441    132,896     158,781</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
